    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `stream_chunks.py` that streams audio chunks from an asynchronous source using a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS Polly service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that can stream audio. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Polly client to stream audio chunks. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
